cburnett chess piece set
========================

Files: wK.svg wQ.svg wR.svg wB.svg wN.svg wP.svg
       bK.svg bQ.svg bR.svg bB.svg bN.svg bP.svg

Upstream author
---------------
Colin M.L. Burnett ("Cburnett").
Originally published on Wikimedia Commons as the SVG chess piece set
"Cburnett", widely known as the default piece set of lichess.org.

Source of these exact files
---------------------------
Vendored (downloaded verbatim, unmodified) from the lila repository:

  https://github.com/lichess-org/lila
  public/piece/cburnett/{wK,wQ,wR,wB,wN,wP,bK,bQ,bR,bB,bN,bP}.svg

